[[Here is a patch that implements two improvements to saa, the Streets
and Alleys game of solitaire.  The first change adds commands aliases
for those without a numeric keypad.  The second change adds the
ability to to save and restore games.  Now you can save a game, try
some things, and restore the old game if things don't work.  Thanks go
to Byron Burke for this suggestion.
John]]

